Jeans: lineSubtotal 50.00, 25% off => 37.50
Socks: lineSubtotal 20.00, 0% off => 20.00
Discounted subtotal = 93.50
Tax 8.25% => 93.50 + (8.25% of 93.50) = 101.21375

