If you need a “clean” rounded value (for display or fixed-decimal requirements), rounding is done via a separate utility method in IntegersAndDecimals.cs:

public static double RoundToDecimalPlaces(double number, int decimalPlaces)
{
    if (decimalPlaces < 0)
